{"unit_id":"Qiao-NEYC__silverhand-dsh-pet#card-zh","repo":"Qiao-NEYC/silverhand-dsh-pet","commit":"dfad6fbf4c4a694c3a9072d50f5ae2e8ef4c6188","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Silverhand desktop pet 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的桌面宠物插件，在界面右下角显示可交互的动画角色。宿主侧监听 agent 状态、工具结果、错误、会话创建和审批请求，并提供精灵图与当前状态路由；浏览器侧把组件注入 shell.overlay，每 300 毫秒获取状态并播放对应动画。用户可以拖动宠物改变位置，拖动时按方向行走，点击则跳跃，悬停可查看状态。适合希望在 Web 界面直观看到 agent 活动并添加轻量互动挂件的用户。需要将插件加入 DSH profile bundle 并重启；代码未读取 API 密钥或配置外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:44-90","lib/client.js:101-120","lib/client.js:142-228"]}
{"unit_id":"Qiao-NEYC__silverhand-dsh-pet#card-en","repo":"Qiao-NEYC/silverhand-dsh-pet","commit":"dfad6fbf4c4a694c3a9072d50f5ae2e8ef4c6188","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Silverhand desktop pet adds an animated companion to the DSH Web interface. The host maps agent events to states and serves a sprite; the browser displays it in shell.overlay and polls every 300 ms. Drag to move it, click to jump, or hover to see its state. Add it to the profile bundle and restart.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:44-90","lib/client.js:101-120","lib/client.js:142-228"]}
